previous_name_on_token_text.description:
Gets or sets the text describing the previous name on the token. If previous_name_on_token is present, this field contains descriptive text for the previous_name_on_token field value.

This field will have a value of one of the following:

The service has updated the name stored against the card token to the newly validated value provided on the request: {NameValue}

